 alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260817/zhanbao_image_2122731_1786898124_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">埃斯皮替补建功，库库雷利亚和迪奥曼德替补登场上演首秀，最终皇马3-0击败沙尔克04。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-17/match2135973date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨5-2巴塞尔 阿德耶米、亚马尔传射 18岁比西武2分钟双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.62" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260817/zhanbao_image_2135973_1786897490_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.62" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.62" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260817/zhanbao_image_2135973_1786897490_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260817/zhanbao_image_2135973_1786897490_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">18岁小将比西武两分钟梅开二度，巴萨5-2大胜巴塞尔。</span></p><p><strong><span style=" 51, 51);">【Here we go！】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-17/6a82017032d20native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">重磅HWG！罗马诺：巴萨签罗德里达协议，转会费总价可达7600万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/202608170230581705_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/202608170230581705_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/202608170230581705_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">名记罗马诺以标志性的“HWG”确认，巴萨已经敲定从曼城引进30岁后腰罗德里的交易！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-17/6a81f0c9c46f2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：32岁坎塞洛即将自由身加盟巴萨，已与新月完成解约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/202608170119491290_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/202608170119491290_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/202608170119491290_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">名记罗马诺以标志性的“HWG”宣布，32岁的葡萄牙边后卫坎塞洛已经与新月完成解约，即将自由身回归巴萨。这将是坎塞洛第三次为巴萨效力，这次双方将签下一份正式合同。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-17/6a8228e331cd2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG确认！罗马诺：总价1200万欧，巴萨小将马奎斯即将转会布拉加</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260817/202608170521028209.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100